called divisive clustering, where you start&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:43:38.890 --> 01:43:43.780
with everything in one group, and then you split&nbsp;
them apart, or agglomerative, which is where they&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:43:43.780 --> 01:43:48.670
all start separately, and you selectively put&nbsp;
them together. But we're going to try to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:43:48.670 --> 01:43:54.010
